It seems you're transferring a save from Vanilla <<- $saveVersions.last()>> to DoLX. <span class="gold">Please check your game settings in a safe room like your bedroom to check Modded Settings!</span> Not doing this will result in you missing out on 99% of DoLX's content! DoLX is built on top of DoLP, with the idea of player Sex change and Gender Identity so nearly everything is a setting the player can change.
